$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~26 min | Difficulty: Medium]] A Cylon raiding fleet died in the Perihelion belt two years ago, and Command wants what its wrecks are still broadcasting. The Raptor Lantern surveys four hulks while Red flight keeps the scavengers off her. Each stop takes its time.", -1)
$end_multi_text

